    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29127" root="عسل" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَسَّالٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَاسِلٌ</span>. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also, (S, O, Msb, K,)
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَاسِلٌ</span></b> , (Msb, K,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَسُولٌ</span></b> , (K,) A
spear <i>that quivers,</i> (S, O, Msb,) by reason of
pliableness: (Msb:) or [so the second, but the
first and last,] a spear <i>that quivers much.</i> (K.)
And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رِمَاحٌ عَسَّالَةٌ</span> [<i>Spears that quiver much</i>]. (A
in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زعب</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See, again, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَاسِلٌ</span>.

